── SYNTAX ERROR ────────────────────────── E0100_union_of_types.lt:1:11  [E0100]

Stilt's variant type names each case, as `type Id = | Name(str) | Number(i64)`:

  1 │ type Id = str | i64
    │           ^^^

A variant type is `type`, its name, `=` and its variants, each after `|`, each
holding its own values.
